sitioning and integration. The firm also maintains over 30 practice groups, each of which is served by one or more Coordinators who report to the PALs on the management of the practice.", "website": "http://www.klgates.com/", "parent_id": null, "primary_ext": "Org", "updated_at": "2025-07-21T00:12:49Z", "start_date": null, "end_date": null, "connected_relationship_ids": "49703", "connected_category_id": 6, "aliases": ["K&L Gates", "K&L Gates LLP", "Kirkpatrick & Lockhart Preston Gates Ellis"], "types": ["Organization", "Business", "Law Firm", "Lobbying Firm"], "extensions": {"Org": {"name": "K&L Gates", "name_nick": null, "employees": null, "revenue": null, "fedspending_id": null, "lda_registrant_id": "32098"}, "Business": {"annual_profit": null, "assets": null, "marketcap": null, "net_income": null, "aum": null}}, "tags": []}, "links": {"self": "https://littlesis.org/entities/15544-K&L_Gates_LLP"}}, {"type": "entities", "id": 14655, "attributes": {"id": 14655, "name": "NASA", "blurb": "National Aeronautics and Space Administration", "summary": null, "website": "https://www.nasa.gov/", "parent_id": 14635, "primary_ext": "Org", "updated_at": "2026-07-11T07:48:02Z", "start_date": "1958-10-00", "end_date": null, "connected_relationship_ids": "27687", "connected_category_id": 6, "aliases": ["NASA", "NASA", "NATIONAL AERONAUTICS AND SPACE ADMINISTRATION", "NATIONAL AERONAUTICS AND SPACE ADMINISTRATION", "National Aeronautics & Space Administration", "Natl Aeronautics & Space Administration (NASA)"], "types": ["Organization", "Government Body"], "extensions": {"Org": {"name": "NATIONAL AERONAUTICS AND SPACE ADMINISTRATION", "name_nick": "NASA", "employees": null, "revenue": null, "fedspending_id": null, "lda_registrant_id": null}, "GovernmentBody": {"is_federal": true, "state_id": null, "city": null, "county": null}}, "tags": []}, "links": {"self": "https://littlesis.org/entities/14655-NASA"}}, {"type": "entities", "id": 14634, "attributes": {"id": 14634, "name": "Interna